content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Business Owner",
      "description": "Person submitting and managing the company’s certification request",
      "attributes": [
        "Company"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Company",
      "description": "Business seeking certification"
    },
    {
      "name": "Certification Application",
      "description": "Application used to request certification",
      "attributes": [
        "Compliance Document",
        "Auditor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Compliance Document",
      "description": "File showing the company meets certain standards"
    },
    {
      "name": "Auditor",
      "description": "Person reviewing documents and doing on site checks"
    },
    {
      "name": "Audit Coordinator",
      "description": "Person assigning auditors and handling scheduling"
    },
    {
      "name": "On Site Audit",
      "description": "Inspection at the company location"
    },
    {
      "name": "Audit Report",
      "description": "Write up of the auditor’s findings"
    },
    {
      "name": "Certification Board Member",
      "description": "Person deciding if the company gets certified"
    },
    {
      "name": "Certification Decision",
      "description": "Outcome issued after reviewing the audit."
    },
    {
      "name": "Compliance Officer",
      "description": "Person supporting the business with follow up steps"
    },
    {
      "name": "Follow Up Messaging",
      "description": "Messages helping the business fix issues"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluation Meeting",
      "description": "Meeting to talk through audit issues"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Application": {
      "objects": [
        "Business Owner",
        "Company",
        "Certification Application",
        "Compliance Document",
        "Auditor"
      ]
    },
    "Auditing": {
      "objects": [
        "Audit Coordinator",
        "Auditor",
        "On Site Audit",
        "Audit Report"
      ]
    },
    "Board Decision": {
      "objects": [
        "Certification Board Member",
        "Certification Decision"
      ]
    },
    "Client Affairs": {
      "objects": [
        "Compliance Officer",
        "Follow Up Messaging",
        "Evaluation Meeting"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Application--Auditing",
      "Auditing--Board Decision",
      "Board Decision--Application",
      "Auditing--Client Affairs",
      "Application--Client Affairs"
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Application": {
      "derived from": "Application Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Business Owner",
        "Company",
        "Certification Application",
        "Compliance Document",
        "Auditor Assignment"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Auditor -> Auditor Assignment"
      ]
    },
    "Audit Examination": {
      "derived from": [
        "Auditing Subdomain",
        "Board Decision Subdomain"
      ],
      "objects": [
        "Audit Coordinator",
        "Auditor",
        "On Site Audit",
        "Audit Report",
        "Certification Board Member",
        "Certification Decision"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Client Affairs": {
      "derived from": "Client Affairs Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Compliance Officer",
        "Follow Up Messaging",
        "Evaluation Meeting"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
